    "result_text": "All tests pass. \n\n## Summary\n\nThe endpoint returns an `OwnerDto` (not the `Owner` entity directly), so I made three small, cohesive changes:\n\n1. **`Person.java`** \u2014 added a tiny `getInitials()` method plus a private `initial(String)` helper. `firstName`/`lastName` live on `Person`, so this is the cohesive home, and `Person` contains only trivial CC-1 getters/setters (low `WMC_other`). Both new units are CC-1.\n\n2. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 declared a read-only `initials` property on the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n3. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a one-line `@Mapping(target = \"initials\", source = \"initials\")` so MapStruct wires `owner.getInitials()` into the DTO.\n\nThe behaviour is added as new small units rather than by growing any existing method, and no complex function was modified. `J.S.` is produced for `john`/`smith`, and the full suite is green.",
